menu "Lichen console"
    config LICHEN_DEV_COMMANDS
        bool "Debug and test console commands (developer mode, #373)"
        default y
        help
            Builds the commands registered with console_register_dev and `fw dev [on|off|status]`. At runtime they
            run only while developer mode is on (About: press Enter 7 times, or `fw dev on` from the USB console;
            never over Wi-Fi) and are hidden from `fw help` while it is off. Off in the release build
            (sdkconfig.release.defaults, `build.sh release build`): the commands are then not in the image.
endmenu
